<li><a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_rules_by_territory/Mexico/he" class="mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med" title="Commons:חוקי זכויות יוצרים לפי שטחים/מקסיקו (67% translated)" lang="he" dir="rtl">עברית</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_rules_by_territory/Mexico/bn" class="mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med" title="কমন্স:অঞ্চল অনুযায়ী কপিরাইট নিয়মাবলী/মেক্সিকো (30% translated)" lang="bn" dir="ltr">বাংলা</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_rules_by_territory/Mexico/gu" class="mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med" title="Commons:Copyright rules by territory/Mexico/gu (18% translated)" lang="gu" dir="ltr">ગુજરાતી</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_rules_by_territory/Mexico/zh" class="mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med" title="共享资源:各地著作权法规/墨西哥 (60% translated)" lang="zh" dir="ltr">中文</a></li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_rules_by_territory/Mexico/ja" class="mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med" title="Commons:Copyright rules by territory/メキシコ (28% translated)" lang="ja" dir="ltr">日本語</a></li></ul></div>
